advanced.description:
{Advanced Blood Wave}

Unleashes a wave of blood magic that deals damage to all units on the battlefield, except allies possessing Vampirism (Life Drain).

Damage is higher than basic.

expert.description:
{Expert Blood Wave}

Unleashes a wave of blood magic that deals damage to all units on the battlefield, except allies possessing Vampirism (Life Drain).

Damage is significantly higher than basic.
